    {
      "type": "thinking",
      "thinking": "I'm planning the full app structure: adding people with validation, tracking expenses with split calculations using integer cents to avoid rounding errors, computing balances, and implementing a greedy debt-settlement algorithm, all persisted to localStorage with proper money formatting.\n\nFor the design, I'm picking a warm off-white background with navy text and a signal-red accent color, pairing Fraunces for headings with Inter for body text, and checking contrast ratios to make sure everything meets accessibility standards.\n\nI'm deciding to keep the people list simple without a removal feature since that adds complexity and risk without being required. For amount validation, I'll use a strict regex pattern with text input and decimal inputmode to control formatting while keeping the parsing logic simple.\n\nFor the split checkboxes, I'll rebuild them whenever people change, defaulting everyone to checked rather than trying to preserve prior unchecked states—this keeps the logic simpler even if it resets some user selections. After submitting an expense, the form resets fully: description and amount cleared, all checkboxes checked again, and payer selection reset too.\n\nFor errors, I'll dynamically render an error element with data-testid=\"form-error\" only when there's something to show, rather than toggling visibility on a permanent node. For settling debts, I'll sort debtors and creditors, then use a two-pointer greedy match to minimize transfers to at most n-1.\n\nBalances display will use data-cents per person with \"is owed\"/\"owes\" phrasing, and \"settled\" when the amount is zero. Expense shares split evenly with the remainder cents distributed to the first few selected people in order, and everything persists to localStorage under a versioned key storing people and expense records with payer and split info.\n\nFor layout, I'm planning a responsive grid with people and the expense form on one side, and expenses/balances/settle-up on the other, stacking on mobile. Checkboxes stay native for accessibility with styled focus states rather than custom chip replacements, and I'm adding empty-state messaging like prompting the user to add their first person. Starting to write the actual JavaScript now...\n\nSetting up local storage persistence...\n\nNow I'm planning the balances/settle calculation logic and the rendering functions for people, expense forms, expenses list, balances, and settlement suggestions, plus focus management after adding items and HTML-escaping for user-entered names.\n\nWriting checkbox and ID generation logic...\n\nI'm also setting up the fonts and CSS styling, then writing the full implementation.\n\n",
      "signature": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en-CA\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Even Keel — split trip costs fairly</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Even Keel helps a group of friends log what each person paid on a trip and work out who owes whom, so everyone ends up even.\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500;9..144,600&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n  :root{\n    --harbour:#1F3A4D;\n    --harbour-deep:#16293A;\n    --harbour-tint:#E4ECF1;\n    --signal:#C2462B;\n    --signal-deep:#A1381F;\n    --signal-tint:#F8E6E0;\n    --sand:#F6F2EB;\n    --paper:#FFFFFF;\n    --line:#D9D4CA;\n    --line-soft:#E9E4DB;\n    --ink:#1A2730;\n    --ink-soft:#4A5E6B;\n    --moss:#2E6B4F;\n    --moss-tint:#E1EFE7;\n    --radius:10px;\n    --shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(31,58,77,.06), 0 6px 20px -8px rgba(31,58,77,.12);\n    --font-body:'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n    --font-display:'Fraunces', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{\n    margin:0;\n    background:var(--sand);\n    color:var(--ink);\n    font-family:var(--font-body);\n    font-size:16px;\n    line-height:1.5;\n    min-width:320px;\n  }\n  :focus-visible{\n    outline:3px solid var(--signal);\n    outline-offset:2px;\n    border-radius:4px;\n  }\n  .skip{\n    position:absolute;left:8px;top:-60px;\n    background:var(--harbour);color:#fff;padding:.5rem .9rem;border-radius:6px;z-index:10;\n  }\n  .skip:focus{top:8px}\n\n  /* Header */\n  .masthead{\n    background:var(--harbour);\n    color:#fff;\n    border-bottom:4px solid var(--signal);\n  }\n  .masthead-inner{\n    max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:1.1rem 1.25rem 1.25rem;\n    display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;gap:.5rem 1.5rem;\n  }\n  .brand{\n    font-family:var(--font-display);\n    font-weight:600;\n    font-size:1.75rem;\n    letter-spacing:-.01em;\n    margin:0;\n    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;\n  }\n  .brand svg{flex:none;position:relative;top:-1px}\n  .tagline{\n    margin:0;color:#C9D6DF;font-size:.95rem;\n  }\n\n  main{\n    max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:1.5rem 1.25rem 4rem;\n  }\n  .grid{\n    display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1.25rem;\n  }\n  @media (min-width:860px){\n    .grid{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,5fr) minmax(0,7fr);gap:1.5rem;align-items:start}\n    main{padding-top:2rem}\n  }\n  .column{display:grid;gap:1.25rem}\n\n  .card{\n    background:var(--paper);\n    border:1px solid var(--line-soft);\n    border-radius:var(--radius);\n    box-shadow:var(--shadow);\n    padding:1.25rem;\n  }\n  @media (min-width:600px){.card{padding:1.5rem}}\n  .card-head{\n    display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;\n    margin-bottom:1rem;\n  }\n  h2{\n    font-family:var(--font-display);\n    font-weight:600;\n    font-size:1.375rem;\n    letter-spacing:-.01em;\n    margin:0;\n    color:var(--harbour);\n  }\n  .card-head .meta{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.9rem;margin:0}\n  .lede{color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0 0 1rem;font-size:.95rem}\n\n  /* Forms */\n  .field{display:grid;gap:.35rem;margin-bottom:.9rem}\n  label, .legend{\n    font-weight:500;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--harbour);\n  }\n  .hint{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:400}\n  input[type=text], select{\n    font:inherit;\n    width:100%;\n    padding:.65rem .75rem;\n    border:1.5px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius:8px;\n    background:#fff;\n    color:var(--ink);\n    min-height:46px;\n  }\n  input[type=text]:focus-visible, select:focus-visible{\n    outline:3px solid var(--signal);outline-offset:1px;border-color:var(--signal);\n  }\n  input[aria-invalid=\"true\"]{border-color:var(--signal)}\n  .amount-wrap{position:relative}\n  .amount-wrap .prefix{\n    position:absolute;left:.8rem;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);\n    color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:500;pointer-events:none;\n  }\n  .amount-wrap input{padding-left:1.7rem}\n  .row{display:grid;gap:.9rem;grid-template-columns:1fr}\n  @media (min-width:460px){.row{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}\n  .inline-add{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:.6rem;align-items:end}\n  .inline-add .field{margin-bottom:0}\n\n  fieldset{border:0;padding:0;margin:0 0 .9rem}\n  legend{padding:0;margin-bottom:.4rem}\n  .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem}\n  .chip{\n    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;\n    padding:.45rem .8rem .45rem .65rem;\n    border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;\n    background:#fff;cursor:pointer;font-weight:500;font-size:.92rem;color:var(--ink);\n    min-height:40px;\n  }\n  .chip:has(input:checked){background:var(--harbour-tint);border-color:var(--harbour);color:var(--harbour)}\n  .chip:has(input:focus-visible){outline:3px solid var(--signal);outline-offset:2px}\n  .chip input{\n    width:18px;height:18px;margin:0;accent-color:var(--harbour);\n  }\n  .chip input:focus-visible{outline:none}\n\n  button{\n    font:inherit;font-weight:600;\n    border-radius:8px;border:1.5px solid transparent;\n    padding:.65rem 1.1rem;min-height:46px;\n    cursor:pointer;\n  }\n  .btn-primary{background:var(--signal);color:#fff;border-color:var(--signal)}\n  .btn-primary:hover{background:var(--signal-deep);border-color:var(--signal-deep)}\n  .btn-secondary{background:var(--harbour);color:#fff;border-color:var(--harbour)}\n  .btn-secondary:hover{background:var(--harbour-deep)}\n  .btn-ghost{\n    background:transparent;color:var(--harbour);border-color:var(--line);\n    padding:.4rem .75rem;min-height:36px;font-size:.88rem;font-weight:500;\n  }\n  .btn-ghost:hover{background:var(--signal-tint);color:var(--signal-deep);border-color:var(--signal)}\n  .form-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.9rem;flex-wrap:wrap}\n\n  .error{\n    display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:flex-start;\n    background:var(--signal-tint);color:var(--signal-deep);\n    border-left:3px solid var(--signal);\n    padding:.6rem .8rem;border-radius:6px;\n    font-size:.92rem;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 .9rem;\n  }\n  .error svg{flex:none;margin-top:3px}\n\n  /* Lists */\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  .people{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem;margin-top:1rem}\n  .person{\n    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;\n    padding:.4rem .85rem .4rem .5rem;border-radius:999px;\n    background:var(--harbour-tint);color:var(--harbour);font-weight:500;font-size:.95rem;\n  }\n  .avatar{\n    width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;\n    background:var(--harbour);color:#fff;\n    display:inline-grid;place-items:center;\n    font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:600;font-size:.85rem;\n  }\n  .avatar.alt{background:var(--signal)}\n\n  .expense{\n    display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:.25rem 1rem;\n    padding:.9rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line-soft);\n  }\n  .expense:first-child{border-top:0;padding-top:0}\n  .expense .desc{font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);margin:0;word-break:break-word}\n  .expense .amt{\n    font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:600;font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--harbour);\n    font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap;justify-self:end;\n  }\n  .expense .who{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.9rem;margin:0;grid-column:1}\n  .expense .who strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:500}\n  .expense .actions{grid-column:2;justify-self:end;align-self:end}\n\n  .balances{display:grid;gap:.5rem}\n  .balance{\n    display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;align-items:center;gap:.75rem;\n    padding:.65rem .75rem;border-radius:8px;background:var(--sand);\n  }\n  .balance .name{font-weight:500;min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}\n  .balance .state{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--ink-soft);display:block}\n  .balance .val{\n    font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:600;font-size:1.15rem;\n    font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap;\n  }\n  .balance.pos .val{color:var(--moss)}\n  .balance.neg .val{color:var(--signal-deep)}\n  .balance.zero .val{color:var(--ink-soft)}\n\n  .transfers{display:grid;gap:.6rem}\n  .transfer{\n    display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:.2rem .75rem;align-items:center;\n    padding:.8rem .9rem;border:1.5px solid var(--line-soft);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;\n  }\n  .transfer .flow{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:.35rem .5rem;font-weight:500}\n  .transfer .arrow{color:var(--signal);display:inline-flex}\n  .transfer .val{\n    font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:600;font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--harbour);\n    font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap;\n  }\n  .settled{\n    display:flex;gap:.6rem;align-items:center;\n    background:var(--moss-tint);color:var(--moss);border-radius:8px;padding:.8rem .9rem;font-weight:500;\n  }\n\n  .empty{\n    border:1.5px dashed var(--line);border-radius:8px;\n    padding:1rem;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.95rem;text-align:center;\n  }\n  .empty p{margin:0}\n  .empty strong{color:var(--harbour);display:block;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.2rem}\n\n  .total-bar{\n    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;\n    padding:.75rem .9rem;background:var(--harbour);color:#fff;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:1rem;\n  }\n  .total-bar span:last-child{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:600;font-size:1.15rem;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n\n  footer{\n    max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.25rem 2rem;\n    color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.85rem;\n  }\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#app\">Skip to the app</a>\n<header class=\"masthead\">\n  <div class=\"masthead-inner\">\n    <h1 class=\"brand\">\n      <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 28\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\">\n        <circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"14\" r=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C2462B\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n        <path d=\"M6 15.5c2.2 0 2.2 1.6 4.4 1.6s2.2-1.6 4.4-1.6 2.2 1.6 4.4 1.6 2.2-1.6 4.4-1.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n        <path d=\"M14 6v7\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n      </svg>\n      Even Keel\n    </h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">Log what you each paid. See who owes whom. End the trip even.</p>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"app\" data-testid=\"app\">\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n    <div class=\"column\">\n      <!-- People -->\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"people-heading\">\n        <div class=\"card-head\">\n          <h2 id=\"people-heading\">Who's on the trip</h2>\n          <p class=\"meta\" id=\"people-count\"></p>\n        </div>\n        <form id=\"person-form\" novalidate>\n          <div id=\"person-error-slot\"></div>\n          <div class=\"inline-add\">\n            <div class=\"field\">\n              <label for=\"person-name\">Name</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"person-name\" data-testid=\"person-name\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"e.g. Priya\" maxlength=\"40\">\n            </div>\n            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-secondary\" data-testid=\"add-person\">Add</button>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n        <ul class=\"people\" id=\"people-list\" aria-label=\"People on the trip\"></ul>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Expense form -->\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"expense-form-heading\">\n        <div class=\"card-head\">\n          <h2 id=\"expense-form-heading\">Log an expense</h2>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"lede\">One person paid. Pick who it's for and the cost is split evenly between them.</p>\n        <form id=\"expense-form\" novalidate>\n          <div id=\"expense-error-slot\"></div>\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"field\">\n              <label for=\"expense-desc\">What was it for?</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"expense-desc\" data-testid=\"expense-desc\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"e.g. Groceries, Tuesday\" maxlength=\"80\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"field\">\n              <label for=\"expense-amount\">Amount <span class=\"hint\">(CAD)</span></label>\n              <div class=\"amount-wrap\">\n                <span class=\"prefix\" aria-hidden=\"true\">$</span>\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"expense-amount\" data-testid=\"expense-amount\" inputmode=\"decimal\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"0.00\">\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"field\">\n            <label for=\"expense-payer\">Who paid?</label>\n            <select id=\"expense-payer\" data-testid=\"expense-payer\"></select>\n          </div>\n          <fieldset>\n            <legend class=\"legend\">Split between <span class=\"hint\">(everyone is selected to start)</span></legend>\n            <div class=\"chips\" id=\"expense-split\" data-testid=\"expense-split\"></div>\n          </fieldset>\n          <div class=\"form-actions\">\n            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-primary\" data-testid=\"add-expense\">Add expense</button>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"column\">\n      <!-- Expenses list -->\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"expenses-heading\">\n        <div class=\"card-head\">\n          <h2 id=\"expenses-heading\">Expenses</h2>\n          <p class=\"meta\" id=\"expenses-count\"></p>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"expenses-total\"></div>\n        <ul id=\"expenses-list\" aria-label=\"Expenses, newest first\"></ul>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Balances -->\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"balances-heading\">\n        <div class=\"card-head\">\n          <h2 id=\"balances-heading\">Where you each stand</h2>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"lede\">What you paid, minus your share of everything. Owing a friend a bit is normal — this just keeps it clear.</p>\n        <div id=\"balances\"></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Settle up -->\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"settle-heading\">\n        <div class=\"card-head\">\n          <h2 id=\"settle-heading\">Settle up</h2>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"lede\">The fewest transfers that bring everyone back to zero.</p>\n        <div id=\"transfers\"></div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"sr-only\" aria-live=\"polite\" id=\"live\"></div>\n</main>\n\n<footer>\n  <p>Your trip is saved in this browser only. Nothing is sent anywhere.</p>\n</footer>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  'use strict';\n  const KEY = 'even-keel-v1';\n  const fmt = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-CA', { style:'currency', currency:'CAD' });\n  const money = c => fmt.format(c / 100);\n\n  let state = load();\n\n  function load(){\n    try{\n      const s = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));\n      if (s && Array.isArray(s.people) && Array.isArray(s.expenses)) {\n        return {\n          people: s.people.filter(p => typeof p === 'string'),\n          expenses: s.expenses.filter(e => e && typeof e.desc === 'string' && Number.isInteger(e.cents) && typeof e.payer === 'string' && Array.isArray(e.split))\n        };\n      }\n    }catch(e){}\n    return { people: [], expenses: [] };\n  }\n  function save(){\n    try{ localStorage.setItem(KEY, JSON.stringify(state)); }catch(e){}\n  }\n\n  // ---------- helpers ----------\n  const $ = id => document.getElementById(id);\n  function el(tag, attrs, children){\n    const n = document.createElement(tag);\n    if (attrs) for (const k in attrs) {\n      if (k === 'text') n.textContent = attrs[k];\n      else if (k === 'html') n.innerHTML = attrs[k];\n      else n.setAttribute(k, attrs[k]);\n    }\n    if (children) children.forEach(c => { if (c) n.appendChild(typeof c === 'string' ? document.createTextNode(c) : c); });\n    return n;\n  }\n  function initials(name){\n    const parts = name.split(/\\s+/).filter(Boolean);\n    return (parts.length > 1 ? parts[0][0] + parts[parts.length-1][0] : name.slice(0,2)).toUpperCase();\n  }\n  function listNames(names){\n    if (names.length <= 1) return names.join('');\n    if (names.length === 2) return names[0] + ' and ' + names[1];\n    return names.slice(0,-1).join(', ') + ' and ' + names[names.length-1];\n  }\n  function announce(msg){ const l = $('live'); l.textContent = ''; setTimeout(()=>{ l.textContent = msg; }, 20); }\n\n  function errorIcon(){\n    const s = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg','svg');\n    s.setAttribute('width','16'); s.setAttribute('height','16'); s.setAttribute('viewBox','0 0 16 16'); s.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');\n    s.innerHTML = '<circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M8 4.5v4M8 11v.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>';\n    return s;\n  }\n  function showError(slotId, msg){\n    const slot = $(slotId);\n    slot.innerHTML = '';\n    if (!msg) return;\n    const p = el('p', { class:'error', role:'alert', 'data-testid':'form-error' }, [errorIcon(), el('span', { text: msg })]);\n    slot.appendChild(p);\n  }\n  function clearError(slotId){ $(slotId).innerHTML = ''; }\n\n  // ---------- money maths (integer cents) ----------\n  function parseAmount(raw){\n    const s = String(raw).trim().replace(/^\\$/, '').replace(/,/g, '');\n    if (s === '') return { error: 'Enter an amount.' };\n    if (!/^\\d*\\.?\\d*$/.test(s) || s === '.') return { error: 'Enter the amount as a number, like 42.50.' };\n    const dec = s.split('.')[1];\n    if (dec && dec.length > 2) return { error: 'Use at most two decimal places — cents only.' };\n    const cents = Math.round(parseFloat(s) * 100);\n    if (!(cents > 0)) return { error: 'The amount needs to be more than $0.00.' };\n    return { cents };\n  }\n\n  // Shares in trip order; leftover cents go one each to the earliest-added people.\n  function shares(exp){\n    const order = state.people.filter(p => exp.split.includes(p));\n    const n = order.length;\n    const out = {};\n    if (!n) return out;\n    const base = Math.floor(exp.cents / n);\n    const rem = exp.cents % n;\n    order.forEach((p, i) => { out[p] = base + (i < rem ? 1 : 0); });\n    return out;\n  }\n  function balances(){\n    const b = {};\n    state.people.forEach(p => b[p] = 0);\n    state.expenses.forEach(e => {\n      if (b[e.payer] !== undefined) b[e.payer] += e.cents;\n      const s = shares(e);\n      for (const p in s) b[p] -= s[p];\n    });\n    return b;\n  }\n  function settle(b){\n    const debtors = [], creditors = [];\n    state.people.forEach(p => {\n      if (b[p] < 0) debtors.push({ name:p, amt:-b[p] });\n      else if (b[p] > 0) creditors.push({ name:p, amt:b[p] });\n    });\n    debtors.sort((a,c)=>c.amt-a.amt); creditors.sort((a,c)=>c.amt-a.amt);\n    const out = [];\n    let i = 0, j = 0;\n    while (i < debtors.length && j < creditors.length) {\n      const d = debtors[i], c = creditors[j];\n      const x = Math.min(d.amt, c.amt);\n      if (x > 0) out.push({ from:d.name, to:c.name, cents:x });\n      d.amt -= x; c.amt -= x;\n      if (d.amt === 0) i++;\n      if (c.amt === 0) j++;\n    }\n    return out;\n  }\n\n  // ---------- rendering ----------\n  function renderPeople(){\n    const list = $('people-list');\n    list.innerHTML = '';\n    const n = state.people.length;\n    $('people-count').textContent = n ? (n === 1 ? '1 person' : n + ' people') : '';\n    if (!n) {\n      list.appendChild(el('li', { class:'empty', style:'width:100%' }, [\n        el('p', {}, [el('strong', { text:'No one here yet' }), 'Add everyone on the trip, including you.'])\n      ]));\n      return;\n    }\n    state.people.forEach((p, i) => {\n      list.appendChild(el('li', { class:'person', 'data-testid':'person' }, [\n        el('span', { class:'avatar' + (i % 2 ? ' alt' : ''), 'aria-hidden':'true', text: initials(p) }),\n        el('span', { text: p })\n      ]));\n    });\n  }\n\n  function renderExpenseForm(){\n    const sel = $('expense-payer');\n    const prev = sel.value;\n    sel.innerHTML = '';\n    if (!state.people.length) {\n      sel.appendChild(el('option', { value:'', text:'Add a person first' }));\n    } else {\n      state.people.forEach(p => sel.appendChild(el('option', { value:p, text:p })));\n      if (state.people.includes(prev)) sel.value = prev;\n    }\n    const split = $('expense-split');\n    const prevChecked = {};\n    split.querySelectorAll('input').forEach(c => { prevChecked[c.value] = c.checked; });\n    split.innerHTML = '';\n    if (!state.people.length) {\n      split.appendChild(el('p', { class:'hint', style:'margin:0', text:'People you add will show up here.' }));\n      return;\n    }\n    state.people.forEach((p, i) => {\n      const id = 'split-' + i;\n      const cb = el('input', { type:'checkbox', id, value:p });\n      cb.checked = prevChecked[p] === undefined ? true : prevChecked[p];\n      split.appendChild(el('label', { class:'chip', for:id }, [cb, el('span', { text:p })]));\n    });\n  }\n\n  function renderExpenses(){\n    const list = $('expenses-list');\n    list.innerHTML = '';\n    const n = state.expenses.length;\n    $('expenses-count').textContent = n ? (n === 1 ? '1 expense' : n + ' expenses') : '';\n    const totalSlot = $('expenses-total');\n    totalSlot.innerHTML = '';\n    if (!n) {\n      list.appendChild(el('li', { class:'empty' }, [\n        el('p', {}, [el('strong', { text:'Nothing logged yet' }), state.people.length ? 'Add the first thing someone paid for — a meal, the gas, the rental.' : 'Once there are people on the trip, log what each of you paid for.'])\n      ]));\n      return;\n    }\n    const total = state.expenses.reduce((s,e)=>s+e.cents,0);\n    totalSlot.appendChild(el('div', { class:'total-bar' }, [el('span', { text:'Trip total so far' }), el('span', { text: money(total) })]));\n    [...state.expenses].reverse().forEach(e => {\n      const splitNames = state.people.filter(p => e.split.includes(p));\n      const btn = el('button', { type:'button', class:'btn-ghost', 'data-testid':'delete-expense', 'aria-label':'Remove ' + e.desc, text:'Remove' });\n      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        state.expenses = state.expenses.filter(x => x.id !== e.id);\n        save(); renderAll();\n        announce('Removed ' + e.desc + '.');\n      });\n      list.appendChild(el('li', { class:'expense', 'data-testid':'expense' }, [\n        el('p', { class:'desc', text: e.desc }),\n        el('span', { class:'amt', text: money(e.cents) }),\n        el('p', { class:'who' }, [el('strong', { text: e.payer }), ' paid · split between ', el('strong', { text: listNames(splitNames) })]),\n        el('div', { class:'actions' }, [btn])\n      ]));\n    });\n  }\n\n  function renderBalances(b){\n    const box = $('balances');\n    box.innerHTML = '';\n    if (!state.people.length) {\n      box.appendChild(el('div', { class:'empty' }, [el('p', {}, [el('strong', { text:'No balances yet' }), 'Add people and expenses and this will fill in.'])]));\n      return;\n    }\n    const wrap = el('ul', { class:'balances', 'aria-label':'Balances' });\n    state.people.forEach((p, i) => {\n      const c = b[p];\n      const cls = c > 0 ? 'pos' : c < 0 ? 'neg' : 'zero';\n      const stateText = c > 0 ? 'is owed' : c < 0 ? 'owes' : 'all even';\n      wrap.appendChild(el('li', { class:'balance ' + cls, 'data-testid':'balance', 'data-person':p, 'data-cents':String(c) }, [\n        el('span', { class:'avatar' + (i % 2 ? ' alt' : ''), 'aria-hidden':'true', text: initials(p) }),\n        el('span', { class:'name' }, [p, el('span', { class:'state', text: stateText })]),\n        el('span', { class:'val', text: (c < 0 ? '−' : c > 0 ? '+' : '') + money(Math.abs(c)) })\n      ]));\n    });\n    box.appendChild(wrap);\n  }\n\n  function renderTransfers(b){\n    const box = $('transfers');\n    box.innerHTML = '';\n    if (!state.people.length || !state.expenses.length) {\n      box.appendChild(el('div', { class:'empty' }, [el('p', {}, [el('strong', { text:'Nothing to settle yet' }), 'As soon as someone pays for something, the transfers show up here.'])]));\n      return;\n    }\n    const t = settle(b);\n    if (!t.length) {\n      const ok = el('div', { class:'settled' });\n      ok.innerHTML = '<svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><path d=\"M6 10.5l2.6 2.5L14 7.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>';\n      ok.appendChild(el('span', { text:\"You're all even. Nothing to settle.\" }));\n      box.appendChild(ok);\n      return;\n    }\n    const wrap = el('ul', { class:'transfers', 'aria-label':'Transfers to settle up' });\n    t.forEach(x => {\n      const arrow = el('span', { class:'arrow', 'aria-hidden':'true' });\n      arrow.innerHTML = '<svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\"><path d=\"M3 9h11M10 5l4 4-4 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>';\n      wrap.appendChild(el('li', { class:'transfer', 'data-testid':'transfer', 'data-from':x.from, 'data-to':x.to, 'data-cents':String(x.cents) }, [\n        el('span', { class:'flow' }, [el('span', { text:x.from }), arrow, el('span', { class:'sr-only', text:'pays' }), el('span', { text:x.to })]),\n        el('span', { class:'val', text: money(x.cents) })\n      ]));\n    });\n    box.appendChild(wrap);\n    box.appendChild(el('p', { class:'hint', style:'margin:.75rem 0 0', text: t.length === 1 ? 'One transfer and you\\'re done.' : t.length + ' transfers and you\\'re done.' }));\n  }\n\n  function renderAll(){\n    const b = balances();\n    renderPeople();\n    renderExpenseForm();\n    renderExpenses();\n    renderBalances(b);\n    renderTransfers(b);\n  }\n\n  // ---------- events ----------\n  $('person-form').addEventListener('submit', ev => {\n    ev.preventDefault();\n    const input = $('person-name');\n    const name = input.value.trim();\n    input.removeAttribute('aria-invalid');\n    if (!name) {\n      showError('person-error-slot', 'Enter a name before adding.');\n      input.setAttribute('aria-invalid','true'); input.focus(); return;\n    }\n    if (state.people.some(p => p.toLowerCase() === name.toLowerCase())) {\n      showError('person-error-slot', `${name} is already on the trip. Try a nickname or add a last initial.`);\n      input.setAttribute('aria-invalid','true'); input.focus(); return;\n    }\n    clearError('person-error-slot');\n    state.people.push(name);\n    save(); renderAll();\n    input.value = '';\n    input.focus();\n    announce(name + ' added to the trip.');\n  });\n  $('person-name').addEventListener('input', () => { clearError('person-error-slot'); $('person-name').removeAttribute('aria-invalid'); });\n\n  $('expense-form').addEventListener('submit', ev => {\n    ev.preventDefault();\n    const descIn = $('expense-desc'), amtIn = $('expense-amount'), payerSel = $('expense-payer');\n    [descIn, amtIn].forEach(i => i.removeAttribute('aria-invalid'));\n    const desc = descIn.value.trim();\n    const amount = parseAmount(amtIn.value);\n    const payer = payerSel.value;\n    const split = [...$('expense-split').querySelectorAll('input:checked')].map(c => c.value);\n\n    if (!state.people.length) { showError('expense-error-slot', 'Add at least one person to the trip before logging an expense.'); $('person-name').focus(); return; }\n    if (!desc) { showError('expense-error-slot', 'Say what the expense was for.'); descIn.setAttribute('aria-invalid','true'); descIn.focus(); return; }\n    if (amount.error) { showError('expense-error-slot', amount.error); amtIn.setAttribute('aria-invalid','true'); amtIn.focus(); return; }\n    if (!payer || !state.people.includes(payer)) { showError('expense-error-slot', 'Choose who paid.'); payerSel.focus(); return; }\n    if (!split.length) { showError('expense-error-slot', 'Pick at least one person to split it between.'); const first = $('expense-split').querySelector('input'); if (first) first.focus(); return; }\n\n    clearError('expense-error-slot');\n    state.expenses.push({\n      id: Date.now().toString(36) + Math.random().toString(36).slice(2,7),\n      desc, cents: amount.cents, payer, split, createdAt: Date.now()\n    });\n    save();\n    descIn.value = ''; amtIn.value = '';\n    $('expense-split').querySelectorAll('input').forEach(c => c.checked = true);\n    renderAll();\n    descIn.focus();\n    announce(`Added ${desc}, ${money(amount.cents)}, paid by ${payer}.`);\n  });\n  ['expense-desc','expense-amount','expense-payer','expense-split'].forEach(id => {\n    $(id).addEventListener('input', () => { clearError('expense-error-slot'); $('expense-desc').removeAttribute('aria-invalid'); $('expense-amount').removeAttribute('aria-invalid'); });\n  });\n\n  renderAll();\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>"
